1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,835
M: I just received a call from Larry from our head office, and he said Mr. Wang can't give the presentation tomorrow at our company's annual conference being held at the Prince Hotel because of a sudden illness in his family.

2
00:00:12,555 --> 00:00:14,435
He asked me to take his place at the conference.

3
00:00:15,355 --> 00:00:19,395
Would you happen to know if there is a bus or subway that goes directly from here?

4
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,295
W: I didn't know that you were going to give a speech there.

5
00:00:22,915 --> 00:00:27,255
In fact, Mr. Singh and I are going to be in attendance, and we are planning to drive.

6
00:00:28,035 --> 00:00:29,835
If you'd like, you can ride along with us.

7
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:31,215
M: That sounds wonderful.

8
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,035
What time will you be taking off?

9
00:00:33,545 --> 00:00:37,095
W: We will meet here at 7 since it only takes about an hour to get there.

10
00:00:37,775 --> 00:00:40,365
We might even have time for breakfast once we get there.
